        "title": "Marine Propulsion",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The advance coefficient J is to a propeller what angle of attack is to a wing: it sets the\nwhole operating state. Slip is not waste — a propeller with zero slip produces zero thrust,\nexactly as a wing at zero angle of attack produces (near) zero lift. Some slip is the price\nof force."
    },
