      "text": "A propeller's behavior is captured by three dimensionless coefficients plotted against the\nadvance coefficient J. These **open-water characteristics** come from tank tests or CFD and\nare the propeller's datasheet."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-PROPULSION.md#023",
