        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Marine Propulsion",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   THRUST coefficient:   K_T = T / (rho x n^2 x D^4)\n   TORQUE coefficient:   K_Q = Q / (rho x n^2 x D^5)\n   OPEN-WATER EFFICIENCY: eta_o = (J / 2pi) x (K_T / K_Q)"
    },
